This product includes prompt material adapted from Memoir
(https://github.com/zhangfengcdt/memoir), version 0.2.9, commit
0b92609461d8d3ebeacec55ad26d3250b86558e8.

Memoir is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The adapted prompts are generated at build time from:

- src/memoir/llm/prompts/capture_coding.tmpl
- plugins/codex/skills/memoir-onboard/SKILL.md

Modifications replace Memoir CLI output protocols and integration-specific
infrastructure with instructions that use Memoir MCP tool roles, remove skill
registration and deterministic extractors, and adapt the procedures for an
OpenCode native command/session context.

The upstream Memoir working tree is not modified. The generated prompt files
are included in dist/prompts/. The Apache License 2.0 text is in LICENSE.
